{"seq":2,"slug":"local-payment-methods","title":"本地支付方式接入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/cross-border-payments/local-payment-methods","wordCount":1294,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"本地支付方式接入\">本地支付方式接入</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跨境电商的支付成功率高度依赖本地支付方式的覆盖。在很多市场，信用卡渗透率极低——东南亚银行卡持有率不到 30%，拉丁美洲现金支付仍占 20% 以上。接入目标市场的主流本地支付方式是提升跨境支付成功率和转化率的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 亚太地区&#10;        A1[支付宝/微信 - 中国]&#10;        A2[PayPay/LINE Pay - 日本]&#10;        A3[GrabPay/OVO - 东南亚]&#10;        A4[UPI - 印度]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 欧洲&#10;        B1[iDEAL - 荷兰]&#10;        B2[Bancontact - 比利时]&#10;        B3[Klarna - 北欧]&#10;        B4[SEPA Direct Debit]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 拉美&#10;        C1[PIX - 巴西]&#10;        C2[OXXO - 墨西哥]&#10;        C3[Boleto - 巴西]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 中东非洲&#10;        D1[M-Pesa - 肯尼亚]&#10;        D2[Fawry - 埃及]&#10;        D3[STC Pay - 沙特]&#10;    end&#10;    A1 --&gt; E[统一支付网关]&#10;    B1 --&gt; E&#10;    C1 --&gt; E&#10;    D1 --&gt; E\">graph TB\n    subgraph 亚太地区\n        A1[支付宝/微信 - 中国]\n        A2[PayPay/LINE Pay - 日本]\n        A3[GrabPay/OVO - 东南亚]\n        A4[UPI - 印度]\n    end\n    subgraph 欧洲\n        B1[iDEAL - 荷兰]\n        B2[Bancontact - 比利时]\n        B3[Klarna - 北欧]\n        B4[SEPA Direct Debit]\n    end\n    subgraph 拉美\n        C1[PIX - 巴西]\n        C2[OXXO - 墨西哥]\n        C3[Boleto - 巴西]\n    end\n    subgraph 中东非洲\n        D1[M-Pesa - 肯尼亚]\n        D2[Fawry - 埃及]\n        D3[STC Pay - 沙特]\n    end\n    A1 --&gt; E[统一支付网关]\n    B1 --&gt; E\n    C1 --&gt; E\n    D1 --&gt; E</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>地区</th>\n<th>市场规模</th>\n<th>主流支付方式</th>\n<th>卡支付占比</th>\n<th>本地支付占比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>中国</td>\n<td>3万亿$</td>\n<td>支付宝、微信</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td>85%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>东南亚</td>\n<td>1000亿$</td>\n<td>GrabPay、OVO、GCash</td>\n<td>15%</td>\n<td>60%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>印度</td>\n<td>800亿$</td>\n<td>UPI、Paytm</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>70%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>巴西</td>\n<td>500亿$</td>\n<td>PIX、Boleto</td>\n<td>30%</td>\n<td>55%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>荷兰</td>\n<td>300亿$</td>\n<td>iDEAL</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>65%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"亚太区本地支付\">亚太区本地支付</h2><p>亚太区支付市场高度碎片化，每个国家都有独特的本地支付生态。</p>\n<p>中国市场以支付宝和微信支付为绝对主导，两者合计覆盖超过 90% 的移动支付份额。跨境商户接入通常通过 Alipay+（面向海外商户的跨境收单服务）或支付聚合商（如 Adyen、Stripe 的中国支付方式接口）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface LocalPaymentConfig {&#10;  region: &#39;apac&#39; | &#39;europe&#39; | &#39;latam&#39; | &#39;mena&#39;;&#10;  methods: {&#10;    id: string;&#10;    name: string;&#10;    type: &#39;wallet&#39; | &#39;bank_transfer&#39; | &#39;cash&#39; | &#39;bnpl&#39; | &#39;qr_code&#39;;&#10;    countries: string[];&#10;    currencies: string[];&#10;    settlementCurrency: string;&#10;    settlementCycle: string;&#10;    feeStructure: {&#10;      percentageFee: number;&#10;      fixedFee: number;&#10;      currency: string;&#10;    };&#10;    integration: {&#10;      type: &#39;redirect&#39; | &#39;sdk&#39; | &#39;api&#39; | &#39;qr&#39;;&#10;      sandboxAvailable: boolean;&#10;      certificationRequired: boolean;&#10;      estimatedIntegrationDays: number;&#10;    };&#10;    limits: {&#10;      minAmount: number;&#10;      maxAmount: number;&#10;      dailyLimit?: number;&#10;    };&#10;  }[];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LocalPaymentConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  region</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'apac'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'europe'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'latam'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'mena'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  methods</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'wallet'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bank_transfer'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'cash'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bnpl'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'qr_code'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    countries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    currencies</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    settlementCurrency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    settlementCycle</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    feeStructure</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      percentageFee</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      fixedFee</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    integration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'redirect'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sdk'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'api'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'qr'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      sandboxAvailable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      certificationRequired</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      estimatedIntegrationDays</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    limits</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      minAmount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      maxAmount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      dailyLimit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>印度的 UPI（Unified Payments Interface）是全球最成功的即时支付系统之一，日均交易超过 3 亿笔。UPI 通过 VPA（Virtual Payment Address）实现账户到账户的实时转账，手续费为零。跨境商户可以通过 UPI 国际版或当地支付网关接入。</p>\n<p>日本市场以现金和信用卡为主，便利店支付（Konbini Payment）是线上电商的重要补充——用户在线下单后到全家、7-11等便利店用现金付款。PayPay（软银/雅虎联合运营）和 LINE Pay 是增长最快的移动钱包。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>亚太支付方式</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>结算周期</th>\n<th>费率</th>\n<th>接入复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>支付宝（跨境）</td>\n<td>钱包</td>\n<td>T+1</td>\n<td>2.2-3%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微信支付（跨境）</td>\n<td>钱包</td>\n<td>T+1</td>\n<td>2.2-3%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UPI</td>\n<td>银行转账</td>\n<td>T+0</td>\n<td>0%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GrabPay</td>\n<td>钱包</td>\n<td>T+3</td>\n<td>1.5-2.5%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PayPay</td>\n<td>钱包</td>\n<td>T+1</td>\n<td>1.98%</td>\n<td>高（需日本实体）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"欧洲与拉美本地支付\">欧洲与拉美本地支付</h2><p>欧洲支付市场受 PSD2 和 SEPA 统一标准的影响，银行转账类支付方式占据重要份额。iDEAL 在荷兰电商中占 60% 以上份额，消费者通过网银完成实时银行转账。SEPA Direct Debit 允许商户定期从消费者的欧元银行账户扣款，适用于订阅场景。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface BankTransferPayment {&#10;  method: &#39;ideal&#39; | &#39;bancontact&#39; | &#39;giropay&#39; | &#39;sofort&#39; | &#39;pix&#39; | &#39;sepa_dd&#39;;&#10;  flow: {&#10;    initiation: &#39;redirect&#39; | &#39;qr_code&#39; | &#39;api&#39;;&#10;    authentication: &#39;bank_login&#39; | &#39;otp&#39; | &#39;biometric&#39;;&#10;    confirmation: &#39;real_time&#39; | &#39;async_webhook&#39;;&#10;    settlement: &#39;instant&#39; | &#39;same_day&#39; | &#39;next_day&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  bankSelection: {&#10;    required: boolean;&#10;    bankListSource: &#39;api&#39; | &#39;static&#39;;&#10;    popularBanks: string[];&#10;  };&#10;  webhookEvents: (&#39;pending&#39; | &#39;authorized&#39; | &#39;completed&#39; | &#39;failed&#39; | &#39;expired&#39;)[];&#10;  expiryMinutes: number;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BankTransferPayment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ideal'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bancontact'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'giropay'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sofort'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pix'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sepa_dd'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  flow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    initiation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'redirect'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'qr_code'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'api'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    authentication</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bank_login'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'otp'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><s