/span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    previousPaymentMethod</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  recommendations</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    methodId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    displayName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    icon</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    rank</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'popular_in_region'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'user_preference'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'best_rate'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fastest_settlement'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    estimatedSuccessRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  fallbackMethods</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  displayConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    maxVisible</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    showMore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    groupByType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>推荐策略的优先级：用户历史偏好 &gt; 地区流行度 &gt; 交易金额匹配 &gt; 支付成功率。对于回头客优先展示其上次使用的支付方式；对于新用户展示该国/地区市场份额最高的支付方式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>推荐信号</th>\n<th>权重</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户历史支付方式</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>用户画像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IP 地理位置</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>GeoIP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备类型</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>User-Agent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交易金额</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>购物车</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付方式成功率</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>后端统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算费率</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>商户配置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>跨境电商必须接入目标市场的本地支付方式，多数新兴市场的卡支付占比不到 30%</li>\n<li>亚太区高度碎片化：中国（支付宝/微信）、印度（UPI）、日本（PayPay/便利店）各有主流</li>\n<li>欧洲受 PSD2/SEPA 影响，银行转账类支付（iDEAL、SEPA DD）占据重要地位</li>\n<li>拉美市场现金支付仍不可忽视（Boleto、OXXO），PIX 正快速成为巴西的支付首选</li>\n<li>智能支付方式推荐根据用户地区、历史和交易特征动态展示最相关的 3-5 种方式</li>\n<li>每种本地支付方式的接入都需要评估：结算周期、费率、合规要求和技术对接复杂度</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"本地支付方式接入","id":"本地支付方式接入"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"亚太区本地支付","id":"亚太区本地支付"},{"level":2,"text":"欧洲与拉美本地支付","id":"欧洲与拉美本地支付"},{"level":2,"text":"支付方式智能推荐","id":"支付方式智能推荐"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"货币兑换与汇率管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/cross-border-payments/currency-exchange"},"next":{"title":"跨境支付合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/cross-border-payments/payment-compliance"}}